---@class aws.imagebuilder.GetWorkflowStepExecutionResponse
---@field requestId? aws.imagebuilder.NonEmptyString The request ID that uniquely identifies this request.
---@field stepExecutionId? aws.imagebuilder.WorkflowStepExecutionId The unique identifier for the runtime instance of the workflow step that you specified in the request.
---@field workflowBuildVersionArn? aws.imagebuilder.WorkflowBuildVersionArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the build version for the Image Builder workflow resource that defines this workflow step.
