---@field scanResultCondition? aws.imagebuilder.ScanResultCondition The condition that the output AMI's scan results must meet for the image to pass. You can set scanResultCondition only when imageScanningTypes is ON_DEMAND_AMI_CVE. If you omit it, Image Builder starts the scan but does not wait for it or use its results to pass or fail the image.

