---@class aws.imagebuilder.ImportComponentRequest
---@field name aws.imagebuilder.ResourceName The name of the component. Image Builder generates the component ARN from a normalized form of the name, so names that differ only in case, spaces, or underscores count as the same name. If a component with the same name and semantic version already exists in your account in the same Amazon Web Services Region, the request creates a new build version for it. If the content is also identical to the...
