---@field retainAtLeast? aws.imagebuilder.LifecyclePolicyDetailFilterRetainAtLeast For age-based filters, this is the number of resources to keep on hand after the lifecycle DELETE action is applied. Impacted resources are only deleted if you have more than this number of resources. If you have fewer resources than this number, the impacted resource is not deleted.

---@alias aws.imagebuilder.LifecyclePolicyDetailFilterRetainAtLeast number

---@alias aws.imagebuilder.LifecyclePolicyDetailFilterType "AGE"|"COUNT"

---@alias aws.imagebuilder.LifecyclePolicyDetailFilterValue number

