---@field instanceMetadataOptions? aws.imagebuilder.InstanceMetadataOptions The instance metadata service (IMDS) settings that Image Builder applies to the EC2 build and test instances it launches during image creation. If you don't set these options, the EC2 launch defaults for the instance apply. For more information about instance metadata options, see one of the following links:
