---
---`PUT /CancelImageCreation`
---Errors: CallRateLimitExceededException, ClientException, ForbiddenException, IdempotentParameterMismatchException, InvalidRequestException, ResourceInUseException, ServiceException, ServiceUnavailableException, ResourceNotFoundException.
